     ppiippee, ppiippee22 — create descriptor pair for interprocess communication

LLIIBBRRAARRYY
     Standard C Library (libc, -lc)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ##iinncclluuddee <<uunniissttdd..hh>>

