HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppiippee() function appeared in Version 3 AT&T UNIX.

     Bidirectional pipes were first used on AT&T System V Release 4 UNIX.

     The ppiippee22() function appeared in FreeBSD 10.0.

     The ppiippee() function became a wrapper around ppiippee22() in FreeBSD 11.0.

